I really doubt these could be considered spoilers but...


1) Dropping an item on an altar will label it cursed/uncursed/blessed
   sometimes it doesn't label it (weapons?) if it's uncursed.

2) Dropping water then praying at an aligned altar will turn it into holy water

3) #offering a fresh corpse on an aligned altar helps your luck/alignment

4) #offering a fresh corpse on an anti-aligned(?) altar causes a struggle
   between your god & whoevers altar it is. (Is this just random or what else
   modifys it?)

5) You can also switch alignments by #offering co-aligned corpses on 
   anti-aligned altars, not real sure why you'd want to do this.

Doing #4 in a temple (altar room w/ a priest) will cause the temple to be
desecrated, and piss off the priest who will attack.  Afterwards whenever you
enter that room there's a chance of a ghost appearing.


